To run the project (for testing):

npm run dev
The console running this command must stay open
( this might break if the port doesnt end up being 5173 )

npm run electron



To actually ship it there's something we can use
https://medium.com/@utkuy.ceng/converting-your-react-app-to-an-electron-desktop-app-5efdafd15d7b
